{"kind":"stack","id":"light-reflection","title":"Light is reflected from surfaces","theme":{"background":"#fdf6e3","foreground":"#073642","font":"Arial, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Reflection"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"When light bounces off a surface and changes direction, this is called reflection."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-q","content":"What happens to light when it hits a shiny surface?"},{"type":"button","id":"c2-a","label":"It bounces back off the surface","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"It soaks into the surface and disappears","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-c","label":"It turns into sound","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Which surface reflects light best?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"A mirror","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"A wooden table","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"A woollen jumper","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-t","content":"You are walking in the sunshine and a beam of light hits a puddle. Do you watch the light bounce up or step over the puddle?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Watch the light bounce up","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Step over the puddle","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-t","content":"You watch closely and see a bright patch of light on the wall. The puddle reflected the sun!"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"You step over the puddle and keep walking. Along the way you notice the puddle still shining in the sun."},{"type":"button","id":"c6-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"Smooth surface"},{"type":"text","id":"c7-e","content":"A smooth, shiny surface reflects light clearly, so you can often see your own reflection in it."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-q","content":"Why can you see your face in a spoon?"},{"type":"button","id":"c8-a","label":"The shiny surface reflects light from your face","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"The spoon makes its own light","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-c","label":"Your face gives off sound","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"What does a reflected light ray do when it leaves a mirror?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"It travels away from the mirror","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"It stops at the mirror","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"It goes inside the mirror","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"Which surface is most likely to make a dull, blurry reflection?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"A rough brick wall","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"A polished mirror","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"A still pond","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-q","content":"How many quiz questions did this stack ask?"},{"type":"button","id":"c11-a","label":"Five","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c12"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c11-b","label":"Three","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c12"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c11-c","label":"Ten","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c12"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c12","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c12-t","content":"Well done! You finished the light reflection lesson."},{"type":"text","id":"c12-m","content":"Light bounces off shiny and smooth surfaces. Keep noticing reflections all around you."}],"actions":[{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"}]}}
